{"ref":"passive:outer-saboteur","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Jimbo.gif","w":40,"h":42}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Ante Chamber)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Outer Saboteur is a familiar passive item from the Ante Chamber DLC of Vampire Survivors. It can be obtained automatically by obtaining any base weapon from Ante Chamber (",{"i":"Sprite-Infernolatro.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:infernolatro"}," ",{"t":"Infernolatro","r":"weapon:infernolatro"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Gros_Michel.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:gros-michel"}," ",{"t":"Gros Michel","r":"weapon:gros-michel"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Fibonacci_Spritz.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:fibonacci-spritz"}," ",{"t":"Fibonacci Spritz","r":"weapon:fibonacci-spritz"},", or ",{"i":"Sprite-Celestial_Booster.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:celestial-booster"}," ",{"t":"Celestial Booster","r":"weapon:celestial-booster"},") or playing as any character from the DLC (",{"i":"Sprite-Jimbo.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:jimbo"}," ",{"t":"Jimbo","r":"character:jimbo"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Canio.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:canio"}," ",{"t":"Canio","r":"character:canio"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Chicot.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:chicot"}," ",{"t":"Chicot","r":"character:chicot"},", or ",{"i":"Sprite-Perkeo.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:perkeo"}," ",{"t":"Perkeo","r":"character:perkeo"},"), even if sealed."]},{"k":"p","c":["It does not take up passive item slots, which means players can obtain up to six other passive items through normal means, such as leveling up."]},{"k":"p","c":["Outer Saboteur can be found as a stage item in ",{"t":"Ante Chamber","r":"stage:ante-chamber-stage"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Passive item","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["28 October 2025 (Update)"]]},{"label":"ID","cells":[["LEM_ACC_SABOTEUR"]]},{"label":"Player stat","cells":[["Gold"]]},{"label":"Rarity","cells":[["35"]]},{"label":"Max level","cells":[["9"]]},{"label":"Bonus per level","cells":[["See table."]]},{"label":"Stacking","cells":[["Additive"]]},{"label":"Max effect","cells":[["+4,500 gold"]]},{"label":"Stage item","cells":[[{"t":"Ante Chamber","r":"stage:ante-chamber-stage"}]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"effects","title":"Effects","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Outer Saboteur provides ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 100 and spawns a floating Jimbo head that follows the player's character as a familiar which uses a special ",{"i":"Sprite-Sossoldi.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:sossoldi"}," ",{"t":"Sossoldi","r":"weapon:sossoldi"},", dividing the threshold to shoot higher gold value projectiles by 10 and locked with a 1-second ",{"i":"Sprite-Cooldown.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:cooldown"}," ",{"t":"Cooldown","r":"powerup:cooldown"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["The follower's stats scale with player's stats."]},{"k":"p","c":["After evolving any weapons from the Ante Chamber DLC, the floating Jimbo will cover the character's head instead of following them and is referred to as Inner Saboteur internally, except for ",{"i":"Sprite-Chula-Reh.png","w":19,"h":24,"r":"character:chula-reh"}," ",{"t":"Chula-Reh","r":"character:chula-reh"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Secretino_Dagsson.png","w":23,"h":24,"r":"character:secretino-dagsson"}," ",{"t":"Secretino Dagsson","r":"character:secretino-dagsson"},", Jimbo, Canio, Chicot, and Perkeo."]},{"k":"p","c":["When using this item to evolve either ",{"i":"Sprite-Infernolatro.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:infernolatro"}," ",{"t":"Infernolatro","r":"weapon:infernolatro"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-AnteChamber.png","w":10,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ante Chamber DLC to access"}," or ",{"i":"Sprite-Fibonacci_Spritz.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:fibonacci-spritz"}," ",{"t":"Fibonacci Spritz","r":"weapon:fibonacci-spritz"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-AnteChamber.png","w":10,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ante Chamber DLC to access"}," in co-op, all players with this item must have Outer Saboteur at max level in order to receive any evolutions. This is likely a bug."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"levels","title":"Levels","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Outer Saboteur has 9 levels. At max level, Outer Saboteur provides a total of ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 4,500."]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"cells":[{"c":["Level 1"]},{"c":["Gives you gold coins, then makes an improper use of your savings.[1]"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 2"]},{"c":["Gain 200 gold coins."]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 3"]},{"c":["Gain 300 gold coins."]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 4"]},{"c":["Gain 400 gold coins."]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 5"]},{"c":["Gain 500 gold coins."]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 6"]},{"c":["Gain 600 gold coins."]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 7"]},{"c":["Gain 700 gold coins."]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 8"]},{"c":["Gain 800 gold coins."]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 9"]},{"c":["Gain 900 gold coins."]}]}]},{"k":"ol","items":[{"c":["Gain 100 gold coins."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"evolutions","title":"Evolutions","blocks":[{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Base weapon"],"h":1},{"c":[],"h":1},{"c":["Passive item"],"h":1},{"c":[],"h":1},{"c":["Evolution"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Infernolatro.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:infernolatro"},"\n",{"t":"Infernolatro","r":"weapon:infernolatro"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":["Max level:\n",{"i":"Sprite-Outer_Saboteur.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"passive:outer-saboteur"},"\nOuter Saboteur"]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-NaneInferno.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:naneinferno"},"\n",{"t":"NaneInferno","r":"weapon:naneinferno"}]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Gros_Michel.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:gros-michel"},"\n",{"t":"Gros Michel","r":"weapon:gros-michel"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":["Max level:\n",{"i":"Sprite-Outer_Saboteur.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"passive:outer-saboteur"},"\nOuter Saboteur"]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Cavendish.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:cavend