ll Ante Chamber characters to break in online"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 1 December 2025 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Re-centred Jimbo and Outer Saboteur hit boxes"]},{"c":["Fixed Outer Saboteur has a lingering hitbox where a weapon was evolved."]},{"c":["Fixed Outer Saboteur crash on console"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["hotfix 31 October 2025 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Saboteur only levels up their weapon if it's enabled and they're not dead, fixes Saboteur starting to fire coins when it shouldn't during Dracula and Death cutscenes"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 28 October 2025 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["This item is based on the head of ",{"t":"Jimbo","x":"https://balatrowiki.org/w/Jimbo"}," from ",{"t":"Balatro","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/balatro"},"."]},{"c":["Outer Saboteur, ",{"i":"Sprite-Silver_Ring.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:silver-ring"}," ",{"t":"Silver Ring","r":"passive:silver-ring"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Ring.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:gold-ring"}," ",{"t":"Gold Ring","r":"passive:gold-ring"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Metaglio_Left.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:metaglio-left"}," ",{"t":"Metaglio Left","r":"passive:metaglio-left"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Metaglio_Right.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:metaglio-right"}," ",{"t":"Metaglio Right","r":"passive:metaglio-right"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Torrona's_Box.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:torrona-s-box"}," ",{"t":"Torrona's Box","r":"passive:torrona-s-box"}," are the only passive items with max level 9 instead of the usual 5."]},{"c":["The fact that it does not take up extra space in the passive item slots may be a possible reference to the ",{"t":"Negative","x":"https://balatrowiki.org/w/Negative"}," property from ",{"t":"Balatro","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Balatro"},"."]},{"c":["If ",{"t":"Emergency Meeting (weapon)","r":"weapon:emergency-meeting-weapon"}," has been upgraded before one of the Ante Chamber ones has, the Outer Saboteur will instead be shown getting ejected rather then going on the character's head."]}]}],"subs":[]}]}